Sound stage 4: switch the aw87559 speaker amplifiers on (spesamp=2).

all27: the DSP tone stream now plays fully into the codec (141/140 periods) but nothing is
audible: the amplifiers sit after their reset pulse with EN_SW off. Their reset values already
enable charge pump, boost and PA (SYSCTRL 0x38); set the PA gain low (spesampgain, default 6 =
9 dB instead of the 24 dB reset value) and SYSCTRL 0x78. Adds a 2-byte I2C write.

--- a/bsd/dev/spes_amp.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/spes_amp.c
@@ -233,19 +233,20 @@
 }
 
 /*
- * One message: a 1-byte write (stretch: keep the bus for a repeated START) or a 1-byte read.
+ * One message: a write of len (1 or 2) bytes, packed little-endian in one FIFO word (stretch:
+ * keep the bus for a repeated START), or a 1-byte read.
  * 0 done, 1 NACK, 2 other error, 3 engine stuck (stop using SE1).
  */
